      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِبٌّ</span></b>  <i>Deceit;</i> (JK, Msb, K;) <i>wickedness; dishonesty,</i> or <i>dissimulation;</i> (K, TA;) <i>mischiefmaking;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَبٌ</span></b> : (TA:) <i>guile, art, craft,</i>
or <i>cunning.</i> (Ham p. 537.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبٌّ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3- 
(tropical:)  <i>A rising,</i> or <i>state of agitation and commotion,
of the sea;</i> (JK, K, TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِبَابٌ</span></b> .
(IAar, K.)

